{"title": "Vellioth", "pageid": 39910, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vellioth", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Vampires", "Undead", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Vellioth \"the Martinet\"</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Skull_A_Unfaded.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Vellioth.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/f/f6/Skull_A_Unfaded.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/f/f6/Skull_A_Unfaded.png 1x, /w/images/f/f6/Skull_A_Unfaded.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Vellioth.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a> (apprentice)</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hometown\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hometown</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">Vampire</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n<p><b>Vellioth \"the Martinet\"</b> was a vampire lord in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> and the master of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/25px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/38px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/50px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cazador\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/25px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador</a>.  His skull is located in the western wing of <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador%27s_Dungeon\" title=\"Cazador's Dungeon\">Cazador's Dungeon</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Vellioth's skull can be interacted with to learn the three 'lessons' that Vellioth 'taught' to Cazador. Each of these lessons require a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Wisdom Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> to learn. Following the checks, the party receives the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mass_Scroll\" title=\"Black Mass Scroll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mass_Scroll\" title=\"Black Mass Scroll\">Black Mass Scroll</a>, which details the ascension ritual that Cazador hopes to perform and progresses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Pale Elf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\">The Pale Elf</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Vellioth.27s_Memories\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vellioth's_Memories\">Vellioth's Memories</span></h3>\n<ul><li><i>Vellioth's first lesson is always to dominate. Allow none to be your equal</i>\n<ul><li>When Cazador tried to speak with an old friend, Vellioth drained the friend dry while he watched as punishment.</li></ul></li>\n<li><i>Vellioth's second lesson is that power comes from solitude. To share with others is to be weak, and to be weak is to fail ... and die.</i>\n<ul><li>When Cazador rebelled against Vellioth, he had him impaled for 11 years - for his failure.</li></ul></li>\n<li><i>Vellioth's third lesson is to act not in haste. A near immortal has time to plan, time to act, only when others will pay the price of action</i>\n<ul><li>When Cazador had learned all his lessons, he killed Vellioth in The Rite of Perfect Slaughter while they both laughed.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Vellioth \"the Martinet\" was a vampire lord and the master vampire of Baldur's Gate, succeeding Donella Szarr \"the Architect\" after her death in 1204 DR<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>. He trained Cazador Szarr in the ways of the vampire, distilling this training into three 'lessons'. In 1276 DR, Cazador slew his master, succeeding him as the master vampire of the city. The new vampire lord preserved his old master's skull in a corner of his dungeon, preserving his lessons through means unknown.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Cruelty\" title=\"Eternal Cruelty\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Cruelty\" title=\"Eternal Cruelty\">Eternal Cruelty</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mass_Scroll\" title=\"Black Mass Scroll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Book_Parchment_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Mass_Scroll\" title=\"Black Mass Scroll\">Black Mass Scroll</a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Pale Elf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Pale_Elf\" title=\"The Pale Elf\">The Pale Elf</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note